cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use cemd in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software

title: cemd
abstract: >-
  A Python package for building atomistic models of cements, clays,
  carbonates and oxide glasses, and writing them out ready for LAMMPS. It
  covers assembling the solid, cutting surfaces and pores, filling them
  with a solution, assigning atom types from force-field rules, resolving
  the parameters, and analysing the result.

authors:
